From lam at candiensten.nl  Tue Sep  8 09:00:02 1998
From: lam at candiensten.nl (Longhow Lam)
Date: Tue, 08 Sep 1998 11:00:02 +0200
Subject: [S] S-PLUS gebruikersdag, Dutch S-PLUS user's day.
Message-ID: <35F4F212.752CB38D@candiensten.nl>

Announcing the First Dutch S-PLUS user day.

S-PLUS user day on October 15th 1998
=======================================

The SSP (Section Statistische Programmatuur) is organizing in cooperation with
CANdiensten the first official Dutch S-PLUS user's day. The user day will be
held in: "De Jaarbeurs" in Utrecht, The Netherlands. The main goal of the day is
to set up a permanent S-PLUS user's group where all S-PLUS user's in the
Netherlands share their experiences and ins-and-outs of the S-PLUS data analysis
system. 

On this day two S-PLUS user's will give a talk on how they are using S-PLUS for
their statistical research and their experiences with S-PLUS. The program for
the day is as follows: 

13.00-13.30  Reception with coffee
13.30-13.45  Introduction by: Hans de Vos (SSP)
13.45-14.15  talk 1:    'Spatial statistics with S-PLUS' 
                        by Arnold Dekkers (RIVM)
14.15-14.45  talk 2:    'Empirical Bayesian estimators for an Age period
                        Cohort model of death to a born hearth disease'
                        by Siem Heisterkamp (AMC) 
14.45-15.00  break 
15.00-15.15  Foundation of S-PLUS user's group 
15.15-15.30  Introduction CAN-diensten by Dick Verkerk 
15.30-16.45  Demonstration of S-PLUS by Longhow Lam (CAN-diensten)      
             * S-PLUS 4.5 for Windows
             * modifying the graphical user interface (GUI)
             * SPSS and Excel Wizard
             * S-PLUS 5.0 for UNIX
             * S-PLUS StatServer for deploying analysis and graphics 
16.45-17.30  Hands-on session

To register for this day, send an e-mail to: Douwe van der Sluis.

