     Dear Splus users,
     
     I want to pass along the answer to my question.  I had evidently 
     created a numeric object called "sum", so it was masking the sum 
     function.  To avoid this problem, one should not use names of 
     functions to store data.  
     
     Use:
     
     find(sum)...to identify the location (directory) of sum "functions"
     rm(sum).....to remove the object causing the confusion 
     search().....to list directories where functions are located
     masked()....to list masked functions
     
     thanks again,
     
